    {
      "id": "checkout-payment-call",
      "question": "How does checkout-api call payment-service, and what timeout applies to that call?",
      "answer": "checkout-api calls `payment-service` synchronously over HTTPS as part of the checkout orchestration, specifically to `POST /v1/payments/authorize`\u30105:4\u2020source\u3011\u30105:2\u2020source\u3011. The timeout for that call is **2 seconds**, and there is **no circuit breaker** on the dependency\u30105:5\u2020source\u3011\u30105:2\u2020source\u3011.\n\nOperationally, this means a slow `payment-service` directly blocks checkout requests and can raise checkout latency and errors\u30105:4\u2020source\u3011\u30105:1\u2020source\u3011.",
