      "id": "incident-001-duration",
      "question": "How long did INC-2026-001 last, and what triggered it?",
      "answer": "INC-2026-001 lasted **18 minutes**. The incident report says the timeline ran from the Redis planned maintenance/failover beginning at **09:02 UTC** to resolution at **09:30 UTC**, with the incident itself summarized as lasting 18 minutes\u30105:0\u2020source\u3011.\n\nIt was triggered by a **planned maintenance window on Azure Cache for Redis** that caused a **primary failover**. During that failover, `authentication-service` could not perform session lookups, which led to token validation failures and HTTP 401 responses\u30105:0\u2020source\u3011. The runbook describes this exact trigger as a Redis failover detected by Azure Monitor\u30105:7\u2020source\u3011.",
